      "writtenOn": "2025-09-02T20:56:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think that we can potentially have a race w.r.t to the completion callbacks and the waitableEvent. In the tests, it looks like the assumption is that if `Wait()` returns, then all the completion callbacks should have been called, but from what I can tell, we don\u0027t actually guarantee that here? Unless the dtor on `WaitableEvent` is the one that signals it?",
